  "title": "Driving excellence through a strong company culture",
  "summary": "Culture – it’s a small word, but one with enormous impact. Whether in our personal lives or at work, culture shapes how we behave, interact, and make decisions. At Anglo Ardmore, we often say that culture is what happens when no one is watching. It’s the instinctive way we act, solve problems, and work together Discover how Anglo Ardmore’s strong company culture empowers teams across ship and shore to make safe, ethical decisions and drive operational excellence every day.",
